<section class="form-intro"><a class="back-link" href="/investimentos">‹ Voltar para investimentos</a><span class="eyebrow"><?= htmlspecialchars($investment->institution) ?> · <?= htmlspecialchars($investment->name) ?></span><h2 class="page-heading">Registrar rendimento</h2><p class="page-subtitle">Informe o rendimento apurado no mês. O cálculo percentual é feito automaticamente.</p></section>
<form method="post" action="/investimentos/<?= (int) $investment->id ?>/rendimento" class="form-card compact-form"><input type="hidden" name="_csrf_token" value="<?= htmlspecialchars($_SESSION['csrf_token'] ?? '') ?>"><div class="return-summary"><div><span>Valor aplicado</span><strong>R$ <?= number_format((float) $investment->amount_invested, 2, ',', '.') ?></strong></div><div><span>Conta</span><strong><?= htmlspecialchars($investment->account_name) ?></strong></div></div><div class="form-grid"><label class="field"><span>Mês de referência</span><select name="reference_month"><?php for ($month = 1; $month <= 12; $month++): ?><option value="<?= $month ?>" <?= $month === (int) date('n') ? 'selected' : '' ?>><?= date('F', mktime(0, 0, 0, $month, 1)) ?></option><?php endfor; ?></select></label><label class="field"><span>Ano de referência</span><input type="number" name="reference_year" min="2000" max="2200" value="<?= date('Y') ?>" required></label><label class="field"><span>Valor inicial no período</span><div class="input-prefix"><b>R$</b><input type="number" name="initial_value" step="0.01" min="0.01" value="<?= htmlspecialchars((string) $investment->amount_invested) ?>" required></div></label><label class="field"><span>Rendimento do período</span><div class="input-prefix"><b>R$</b><input type="number" name="return_amount" step="0.01" min="0.01" placeholder="0,00" required autofocus></div></label></div><div class="info-note">A rentabilidade será calculada como rendimento ÷ valor inicial × 100. Esse lançamento atualiza os indicadores, mas não movimenta a conta corrente.</div><div class="form-actions"><a href="/investimentos" class="button button-ghost">Cancelar</a><button class="button button-primary" type="submit">Registrar rendimento</button></div></form>
